---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller != projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_published --> q_revert_state: capital not published
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert CapitalNotPublished
    q_check_published --> q_check_withdrawn: capital published
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_revert_dup: capital already withdrawn
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert CapitalAlreadyWithdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: capital not yet withdrawn
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_fees: calculate legion and referrer fees
    q_transfer_fees --> q_transfer_project: transfer fees to recipients
    q_transfer_project --> q_set_flag: transfer remaining to projectAdmin
    q_set_flag --> [*]: capitalWithdrawn = true, emit CapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: early withdrawal before token supply enabled
        INV-002: no modifications to sale parameters after withdrawal
    end note
